      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i need help drafting a formal letter of intent. it's for the CEO of a major studio—i'm talking like the biggest ones, disney/warner level. i've finally tracked down the physical copies of the dormant contracts that prove my family's original ownership stake in their IP, so i need to reach out and let them know a claim is coming. it needs to sound legal and super serious so they don't just ignore me.",
