      "content": "thanks. that sounds right. i want it to feel heavy, like they'll realize they've been operating on stolen/invalidated rights for decades if they don't settle this. \n\ncould you add a section about the 'dormant' nature of these contracts? basically explaining that because the documents were held in a private family trust/vault, the continuous chain of title was obscured, which is why it hasn't come up in their audits until now. it needs to sound like i have the upper hand because the evidence is undeniable once it's actually surfaced.",
      "source": "evaluator"
